# Ignore everything:
*

# Except this very file:
!.gitignore

# ... and Nick_build/scripts/: the code that builds the inputs in Nick_build/ (data processing kept out of luto/, but
# version-controlled), and each dataset folder's README.md (its source, version, script and outputs). Everything else in
# Nick_build/ (the built data, download caches) stays ignored.
!Nick_build/
!Nick_build/*/
Nick_build/*/*
!Nick_build/*/README.md
!Nick_build/scripts/**
Nick_build/scripts/**/__pycache__/
